{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/7q20fwytf9jobabus09ibagho40iz9z.mp3","text":"我接下来的任务是保护博士你的安全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/br5656pcw9jhk4me2edo8r4hj5swa5q.mp3","text":"我的话不多？实际上，我对大多数事情都没什么感想。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/btu7h6q3lyxlrh25vidus8bp9xcfrrn.mp3","text":"我们的工作是搬运生命和死亡。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/5sv074v2urvkxlkexxyy9vx721u2b1b.mp3","text":"开车的时候我一般会听“空”她自己录的歌。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/kxrt7iaup62uxp8h4xuik0w2midobse.mp3","text":"这不是烟，是巧克力，定期摄入能量是必要的。所以......你要来点咖啡么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/njzgm4f1zp133ys2dotswhydzbsw4p6.mp3","text":"什么时候加入企鹅物流的？嗯......什么时候呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/sh59ngp99u4i1bb6inn40jz9uile2n4.mp3","text":"红色的狼，务必要小心。她不坏，但.....她和我们不一样。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/thdcvudkeozyimifb10awirxdbnius8.mp3","text":"无论怎么逃，我的过去总有一天会追上我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/7iup2flodz6ykcs4rr286lg10tdcmyg.mp3","text":"自由的生活，吵闹的伙伴，虽然总给我带来麻烦，不过......我现在觉得这样也不坏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/slv6tbocrea4wexwf5rka7q54i9aze8.mp3","text":"现在是休息时间吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/6l9ye2ckn5hvxfai3mpxgg8k9wi53pd.mp3","text":"代号德克萨斯，职能包括载具驾驶、货物搬运以及人员安全保障。关于任务的说明，请尽量简单些。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/5hr41mv081dm8de5d7on4rr4t6ghycj.mp3","text":"谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/81u73ijcp64tby5xzmfl1yy1d6r8132.mp3","text":"报酬的话，这些足够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/tj99ny4p8aad89nabnm6bx740wrpuc4.mp3","text":"感谢你的信任，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_102_texas/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/oon2mlr28z8gqy495qeq5iee8alzm1k.mp3","text":"需要我做